382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (The model is structured as a Keras Sequential network. The Embedding layer maps word indices into 64-dimensional dense vectors. An LSTM layer with 128 units processes the sequence vectors, followed by a Dropout layer \(rate = 0.2\) to prevent overfitting. A Dense output layer with softmax activation spans the entire vocabulary size V, outputting a probability distribution over all possible next words. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
